## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 5.3 FlashX Legal
- **Short description:** Z.ai’s legal-domain adaptation of GLM 5.3 FlashX (1M context) combining hybrid sparse/linear attention with domain post-training for contract analysis and compliance workflows (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai / hosted API. Local metadata lists `zai/glm-5.3-flashx-legal`, pricing $0.37/$1.25 per 1M, and multimodal input support.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `glm-5.3-flashx-legal`, `zai/glm-5.3-flashx-legal`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens total; 128K max output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and video input; text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.37/$1.25 per 1M in/out (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary legal-domain adaptation of GLM 5.3 FlashX. Detailed architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed in accessible sources.

